# Go（pindou-backend/bin 是后端二进制，pindou-admin/bin 是网页后台服务的二进制）
bin/
# 网页后台构建产物在 make admin-embed 时复制进来再嵌入二进制；只保留占位说明，让 go:embed 没有产物也能编译
!pindou-backend/internal/adminui/dist/
pindou-backend/internal/adminui/dist/*
!pindou-backend/internal/adminui/dist/README.txt
*.test
*.out

